This project adapts code from:
- Infinity-Parser2 (infly): the doc2json -> Markdown conversion in ocr_eval/models.py
  (extract_json_content, truncate_last_incomplete_element, convert_json_to_markdown).
- OvisOCR2 (ATH-MaaS) model card: the prompt and _clean_truncated_repeats in ocr_eval/models.py.
- olmOCR (allenai, Apache-2.0): page rendering is imported from the olmocr package at run time.
- dots.mocr (rednote-hilab) and chandra-ocr (datalab-to): imported at run time, not copied.

The files in patches/ are changes to MDPBench (MultimodalOCR), ThaiOCRBench and OmniDocBench, and are
distributed under those projects' licenses.
